00:01:07.828 --> 00:01:09.397
SOMETHING TO STRENGTHEN THE

00:01:08.763 --> 00:01:10.998
BACKGROUND CHECK SYSTEM AND MAKE

00:01:09.530 --> 00:01:13.401
IT WORK A LITTLE BETTER.

