WE MIGHT GET SOMETHING THIS TIME

00:01:13.534 --> 00:01:16.370
AROUND.

00:01:14.035 --> 00:01:20.007
I THINK IT'S FAIR TO ADD THAT IN

00:01:16.504 --> 00:01:23.277
THIS CASE, WE HAVE A REAL

00:01:20.141 --> 00:01:25.613
CULPRIT IN THE SENSE OF THE FBI

00:01:23.411 --> 00:01:27.648
AND THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES IN

00:01:25.746 --> 00:01:29.684
FLORIDA DOING SUCH A POOR JOB OF

00:01:27.782 --> 00:01:32.186
RESPONDING TO THE CLEAR WARNINGS

00:01:29.817 --> 00:01:32.853
THEY HAD THAT THIS YOUNG MAN,

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:36.324
THIS VERY YOUNG MAN WHO WAS

00:01:32.987 --> 00:01:37.825
IDENTIFIED TO THEM BY NAME WAS A

00:01:36.457 --> 00:01:39.994
DANGER.

