THE FBI DROPPED THE BALL AND SO

00:01:40.127 --> 00:01:45.399
DID LOCAL AUTHORITIES.

00:01:41.362 --> 00:01:46.067
IT'S POSSIBLE SOMETHING COULD BE

00:01:45.533 --> 00:01:48.035
DONE TO ENCOURAGE A BETTER

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:51.205
RESPONSE BUT IT LOOKS LIKE THAT

00:01:48.169 --> 00:01:51.772
WILL TAKE SOME OF THE FOCUS OFF

00:01:51.339 --> 00:01:53.241
MORE GUN CONTROL.

00:01:51.906 --> 00:01:54.442
&gt;&gt; John: THE PRESIDENT HAS

00:01:53.374 --> 00:01:56.010
TOLD PEOPLE AT MAR-A-LAGO OVER

00:01:54.575 --> 00:01:58.412
