00:01:56.144 --> 00:02:00.014
OUT IN FAVOR OF STRENGTHENING

00:01:58.546 --> 00:02:03.284
BACKGROUND CHECKS, THE BILL

00:02:00.148 --> 00:02:03.885
BEING FLOATED BY SENATORS JOHN

00:02:03.417 --> 00:02:06.120
CORNYN AND CHRIS MURPHY.

00:02:04.018 --> 00:02:08.189
ALL OF THIS WOULD DO WOULD

00:02:06.254 --> 00:02:10.191
IMPROVE THE APPLICATION OF

00:02:08.322 --> 00:02:12.860
CURRENT LAW.

00:02:10.324 --> 00:02:14.262
WITH THAT REALLY ANYTHING?

00:02:12.994 --> 00:02:16.798
&gt;&gt; WELL, IT MIGHT.

00:02:14.395 --> 00:02:18.800
WE DON'T KNOW THAT.

00:02:16.931 --> 00:02:19.968
YOU ARE RIGHT IT'S ALL ABOUT

00:02:18.933 --> 00:02:22.604
CURRENT LAW AND IT'S ABOUT THE

00:02:20.101 --> 00:02:24.205
FAILURE OF CURRENT LAW TO DO THE

00:02:22.737 --> 00:02:25.240
JOB, JUST AS IN THIS PARTICULAR

00:02:24.339 --> 00:02:29.611
CASE WE SAW THE FAILURE OF

00:02:25.373 --> 00:02:30.679
AUTHORITIES TO DO THEIR JOB.

00:02:29.744 --> 00:02:33.415
WHAT MIGHT COME OUT OF THIS

00:02:30.812 --> 00:02:34.783
WOULD BE A RESOLVE IN THAT AREA.

00:02:33.548 --> 00:02:36.317
WHETHER ANYTHING -- FIRST OF

00:02:34.916 --> 00:02:37.118
ALL, YOU HAVE THIS PROBLEM, WE

00:02:36.451 --> 00:02:41.990
ALWAYS HAVE THIS ONE WE HAVE

00:02:37.252 --> 00:02:44.760
THESE EPISODES WHERE SOME WEAPON

00:02:42.123 --> 00:02:46.795
IS USED OR SOME CIRCUMSTANCES

00:02:44.893 --> 00:02:48.630
ENCOUNTERED AND IT TURNS OUT

00:02:46.928 --> 00:02:50.065
WHAT'S BEING PROPOSED TO ADDRESS

00:02:48.764 --> 00:02:52.734
IT WOULDN'T HAVE ADDRESSED THE

00:02:50.198 --> 00:02:58.340
CASE IN PARTICULAR.

00:02:52.868 --> 00:03:00.041
THIS WAS NOT A BAND WEAPON, THIS

00:02:58.473 --> 00:03:02.444
SEMIAUTOMATIC WEAPON WAS NOT.

00:03:00.175 --> 00:03:06.815
EFFORTS TO BAN THOSE IN THE PAST

00:03:02.577 --> 00:03:07.783
HAVE GONE NOWHERE.

00:03:06.948 --> 00:03:09.584
PEOPLE TALKING ABOUT LEGISLATING

00:03:07.916 --> 00:03:10.585
DON'T SEEM TO UNDERSTAND HOW

00:03:09.718 --> 00:03:12.154
THEY WORK OR WHATEVER.

00:03:10.719 --> 00:03:14.890
WE'LL SEE IF THIS IS DIFFERENT

00:03:12.287 --> 00:03:16.191
BUT YOU ARE RIGHT TO BE

00:03:15.023 --> 00:03:17.859
SKEPTICAL.

00:03:16.324 --> 00:03:19.494
&gt;&gt; John: YOU MENTIONED THE FBI

00:03:17.993 --> 00:03:20.495
DROPPING THE BALL ON A TIP THEY

00:03:19.628 --> 00:03:21.830
GOT IN JANUARY THAT THE MAYOR

00:03:20.629 --> 00:03:23.598
MAY NOT HAVE PREVENTED THIS BUT

00:03:21.963 --> 00:03:24.232
AT LEAST THEY WOULD'VE KNOWN

00:03:23.732 --> 00:03:25.534
ABOUT IT.

00:03:24.366 --> 00:03:29.104
THE PRESIDENT TWEETED ABOUT THAT

00:03:25.667 --> 00:03:29.805
OVER THE WEEKEND, SAYING

00:03:29.237 --> 00:03:30.572
"VERY SAD THAT THE FBI MISSED

00:03:29.938 --> 00:03:32.107
ALL OF THE MANY SIGNALS SENT OUT

00:03:30.706 --> 00:03:34.142
BY THE FLORIDA SCHOOL SHOOTER.

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:38.013
THIS IS NOT ACCEPTABLE."

00:03:34.276 --> 00:03:38.780
GOES ON TO SAY:

00:03:38.146 --> 00:03:39.381
"THEY ARE SPENDING TOO MUCH TIME

00:03:38.914 --> 00:03:40.982
TRYING TO PROVE RUSSIAN

00:03:39.514 --> 00:03:41.717
COLLUSION WITH THE TRUMP

00:03:41.116 --> 00:03:42.417
CAMPAIGN.

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:43.151
THERE IS NO COLLUSION.

00:03:42.551 --> 00:03:46.421
GET BACK TO THE BASICS AND MAKE

00:03:43.285 --> 00:03:47.389
US ALL PROUD!"

00:03:46.555 --> 00:03:48.824
THE PRESIDENT WAS WIDELY

00:03:47.522 --> 00:03:50.225
CRITICIZED FOR THAT TWEET.

00:03:48.957 --> 00:03:52.227
DID HE HELP HIMSELF?

00:03:50.359 --> 00:03:52.627
&gt;&gt; I'M SURE IT FIRED UP HIS

00:03:52.361 --> 00:03:54.463
SUPPORTERS.

00:03:52.761 --> 00:03:58.200
A LOT OF THEM SEEM TO LIKE THAT.

00:03:54.596 --> 00:03:59.301
BUT THOSE ARE PEOPLE WHO ARE

00:03:58.333 --> 00:04:00.602
ALREADY WITH HIM AND WILL BE

00:03:59.435 --> 00:04:03.405
WITH HIM.

00:04:00.736 --> 00:04:05.607
IT DOES NOTHING TO EXPAND HIS

00:04:03.539 --> 00:04:07.643
SUPPORT, AND HIS COMMENTS ABOUT

00:04:05.741 --> 00:04:09.611
THE FBI'S PERFORMANCE ON THIS

00:04:07.776 --> 00:04:12.047
CASE ARE PERFECTLY VALID.

00:04:09.745 --> 00:04:13.348
BUT THE FBI IS A GREAT BIG

00:04:12.181 --> 00:04:15.484
INSTITUTION WITH THOUSANDS OF

00:04:13.482 --> 00:04:15.984
