00:04:15.617 --> 00:04:18.120
COUNTRY.

00:04:16.118 --> 00:04:19.755
WHETHER A FAILURE IN THE MIAMI

00:04:18.253 --> 00:04:21.390
FIELD OFFICE OR WHATEVER OFFICE

00:04:19.888 --> 00:04:22.925
WAS RESPONSIBLE HAD ANYTHING

00:04:21.523 --> 00:04:23.959
WHATEVER TO DO WITH THE EXTENT

00:04:23.058 --> 00:04:27.029
OF THE RUSSIAN INVESTIGATION, I

00:04:24.093 --> 00:04:28.997
THINK THAT'S DOUBTFUL.

00:04:27.162 --> 00:04:30.632
SO I THINK THE PRESIDENT WAS

00:04:29.131 --> 00:04:32.234
PROBABLY NOT STANDING ON VERY

00:04:30.766 --> 00:04:33.636
SOLID FACTUAL GROUND THERE IN

